<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fletcher Building raises annual profit.</title>
<headline>Fletcher Building raises annual profit.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   121 vs 117</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 32.3 vs 32.2</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  6.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)			3.58 vs 3.44</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				 86 vs 157</p>
<p>    Tax (credit)				  33 vs debit 42</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	358.49 vs n/a</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation tax credit credits</p>
<p>Pay date Nov 6  </p>
<p>Reg date Oct 25</p>
<p>    Ex div   Oct 29</p>
<p>Note - Fletcher Challenge Building Division Ltd is the construction and building products division of Fletcher Challenge. Analysts had expected a net profit of around NZ$137 million.</p>
</text>
